  "goal": "Say where someone is with -de, -da, -te and -ta.",
  "points": ["gp-locative", "gp-consonant-assimilation"],
  "intro": {
    "text": "Add `-de` or `-da` to a noun to say where: *evde* (at home), *okulda* (at school). After a voiceless consonant (f, s, t, k, ç, ş, h, p) the d becomes t: *parkta*, *ofiste*.",
    "see": "gp-locative"
  },
